  "decision": "Retain v601 as the current source-true technical verification frame. It preserves the v595 bounded deterministic low-discrepancy spray upgrade and the v600 source-equivalent procedural boulder restoration, then replaces only the production-body wetsuit slot's glossy FBX material with the existing physically scaled generated-neoprene material and a skeletal shader permutation. The licensed variant skin, eye, and hair materials remain unchanged. Accept the reduced chrome-gray limb response as a narrow character-material upgrade. Reject v601 for photoreal, marketing, store, press, and human approval because the faces, hands, hair/helmet integration, wardrobe construction, poses, broad water, aerosol, raft, boulder, lighting, shoreline, and terrain remain visibly synthetic or unfinished."
